Когда frames 30
Тогда sp_items in every progress.csv row before Finished active0 is not empty and active0_seconds rises while the name stays the same; the frames of the phases "Starting Vulkan", "Indexing content", "Streaming textures" show an item line with seconds (before: empty / no seconds)
