Тогда sp_bar fraction never falls; the longest interval over which fraction grew by less than 1/bar width is <= 2.0 s (before: 26.3 / 22.2 / 35.5 s); no jump between two samples > 0.5 % (before: 10.1 %)
Тогда sp_eta eta rises only with the plan (follows a rising plan by at most kEtaMaxRiseRate = 1 s per second), never by more than 2 s between two captures one second apart; the longest interval of one whole eta value with eta_known=1 is <= 5.0 s (before: 54.5 s); no sample with eta < 2 before Finished (before: "0:01" for 38.6 s)
Тогда sp_overrun in the second run eta_known=1 in every sample; in the first 0 is allowed, and then the frame shows "longer than expected", not a number
Тогда sp_phases editor.log has 17 lines "[Startup] phase ..." in plan order, none "refused" / "could not begin" / an Expect refusal
